{"availability":"available","full":"SgtPooki/Avalanche-IPFS-Filecoin-RWA-reference-Architecture","name":"Avalanche-IPFS-Filecoin-RWA-reference-Architecture","description":"Verifiable offchain records for tokenized real-world assets on Avalanche, with IPFS CIDs and Filecoin storage proofs","category":"Other","language":"Solidity","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-10T16:29:28Z","updated":"2026-10-07T12:51:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sgtpooki.github.io/Avalanche-IPFS-Filecoin-RWA-reference-Architecture/","topics":[],"demo":"https://sgtpooki.github.io/Avalanche-IPFS-Filecoin-RWA-reference-Architecture/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:55.060Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:55.060Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:55.060Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T21:45:43.306Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2103888602492969270","postId":"2103888602492969270","postedAt":"2026-09-26T16:45:05.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:38.384Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T21:45:43.306Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T00:44:55.060Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A reference architecture and working example showing how RWA issuers can use Avalanche, IPFS and Filecoin to connect onchain assets to durable, content-addressed source records. Tokenized assets depend on deeds, certifications, appraisals and disclosures that don't belong onchain; this pattern lets an application reference those records while anyone can verify the data hasn't changed and is still stored.","An issuer publishes a record set, anchors its manifest on Avalanche, and lets anyone retrieve the documents and check their content and Filecoin storage proof state. The example uses a synthetic property; the same record format can hold inspection reports, loan documents, or equipment certificates."],"featur